                    "value": "WHAT THIS REPORT MEASURES\n\nUHC SERVICE COVERAGE INDEX\nWorld Bank indicator SH_UHC_SCI. Higher is better.\n\nOUT-OF-POCKET SHARE\nWorld Bank indicator SH.XPD.OOPC.CH.ZS. Lower is better.\n\nPROTECTION SCORE\nUHC index minus OOP share; a dashboard-created comparison signal, not an official indicator.\n\nRISK BANDS\nMore protected: UHC ≥60 and OOP <40. High cost: UHC ≥60 and OOP ≥40. Coverage gap: UHC <60 and OOP <40. Critical: UHC <60 and OOP ≥40.",
